# World of Warships OCR + YOLO Tournament Discord Bot

> **Active acceptance contract:** all nine fields are mandatory and must match exactly, in this order: `result`, `player`, `map`, `mode`, `battleStart`, `credits`, `freeXp`, `damage`, `xp`. XP is ninth/final. Missing, invalid, uncertain, conflicting, or incorrect values block acceptance.
